# KDE Config File
[KDE Desktop Entry]
# KEEP THE LINE ABOVE IN THE FIRST 64 BYTES - see vlhe.kdelnk.
#
# vlhe-root.kdelnk - the control centre AS ROOT, for loading and
# unloading and the machine's settings. design/54 G12, design/33
# section 3h. Installed in Applications/System, beside Corel's own File
# Manager (root) entry (FileManagerRoot.kdelnk) - Corel's place for root
# tools, and the shape this file copies: kvt_kappsu opens a
# small konsole for the root password, or runs the program directly
# when already root. kappsu takes a TITLE then the COMMAND - with the
# command alone it runs nothing. Verified on 86Box 2026-10-05.
# @BINDIR@ is replaced by `make install' with the real $(bindir): root's
# PATH under kappsu (`su -') has no /usr/local/bin, so a bare name
# would not be found on a source install.
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas Tranter
# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
# Part of VLHE. See LICENSE for the full license text.
Name=VLHE Control Centre (root)
Comment=Run the VLHE control centre as root - load, unload and the machine's settings
Exec=kvt_kappsu "VLHE Control Centre (root)" @BINDIR@/vlhe.gtk
Icon=vlhe.xpm
MiniIcon=vlhe.xpm
Type=Application
Terminal=0
